  "html": "<p>The Fades are a race of part undead, part mechanical creations. Their forces are versatile and varied, capable of facing many types of situations, and their technology is superb.  Some fades appear to be skeletal in nature, while others have mechanical jaws and robotic limbs or have the appearance of mechanical spiders.\n</p><p>Many technological wonders, such as barriers and generators of unknown purposes are Fade creations, or share a common creator as the Fades.\n</p>\n\n<div id=\"mw-subcategories\">\n<h2>Subcategories</h2>\n<p>There are 8 subcategories to this category.\n</p><table width=\"100%\"><tr valign=\"top\"><td>\n<h3>D</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category/Dread_Mantis\" title=\"Category:Dread Mantis\">Dread Mantis</a></li></ul>\n<h3>F</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category/Fade_Banshee\" title=\"Category:Fade Banshee\">Fade Banshee</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<h3>F cont.</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category/Fade_Devastator!\" title=\"Category:Fade Devastator!\">Fade Devastator!</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category/Fade_General\" title=\"Category:Fade General\">Fade General</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category/Fade_Hatchling\" title=\"Category:Fade Hatchling\">Fade Hatchling</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<h3>F cont.</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category/Fade_Lichlord\" title=\"Category:Fade Lichlord\">Fade Lichlord</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category/Fade_Skeleton\" title=\"Category:Fade Skeleton\">Fade Skeleton</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category/Fade_Widow\" title=\"Category:Fade Widow\">Fade Widow</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n</tr></table>\n</div><div id=\"mw-pages\">\n<h2>Articles in category \"Fades\"</h2>\n<p>There are 76 articles in this category.\n</p><table width=\"100%\"><tr valign=\"top\"><td>\n<h3>A</h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"redirect-in-category\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arctic_Fade_Lichlord\" title=\"Arctic Fade Lichlord\">Arctic Fade Lichlord</a></span></li></ul>\n<h3>B</h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"redirect-in-category\"><a href=\"/wiki